IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SECONDARY-ACCUM-SYNTH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-PRIMARY-ROOT-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
   05 D0-FAULT-FLAG        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 D1-ACTIVATION-STREAM.
   05 D1-ACT-X0            PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-ACT-X1            PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D1-VALVE-EXPONENT-E  PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 D2-SECONDARY-ACCUMULATORS.
   05 D2-SEC-MU-RMS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-SEC-MU-VALVE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-RMS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-VALVE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R12.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-FAULT-FLAG.

    MOVE 1000 TO D1-ACT-X0.
    MOVE 2000 TO D1-ACT-X1.
    MOVE 991220 TO D1-VALVE-EXPONENT-E.

    PERFORM SYNTHESIZE-SECONDARY-ACCUMULATORS.
    PERFORM COMMIT-OR-ROLLBACK-SECONDARY.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU == 1000000 AND D2-COMMITTED-VALVE == 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

SYNTHESIZE-SECONDARY-ACCUMULATORS.
    comment Secondary Accumulator 1: mu_RMS = (x0^2 + x1^2) / 2;
    COMPUTE D2-SEC-MU-RMS = ((D1-ACT-X0 * D1-ACT-X0) + (D1-ACT-X1 * D1-ACT-X1)) / 2.
    comment Secondary Accumulator 2: mu_VALVE = mu mod mu = 0;
    COMPUTE D2-SEC-MU-VALVE = D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU - 
        ((D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU / D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU) * D0-PRIMARY-CHARGE-MU).
    EXIT.

COMMIT-OR-ROLLBACK-SECONDARY.
    IF D0-FAULT-FLAG == 1
        MOVE 0 TO D2-COMMITTED-RMS
        MOVE 0 TO D2-COMMITTED-VALVE
    ELSE
        MOVE D2-SEC-MU-RMS TO D2-COMMITTED-RMS
        MOVE D2-SEC-MU-VALVE TO D2-COMMITTED-VALVE
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-RMS - ((D2-COMMITTED-RMS / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
